                "xpath": "/html[1]/body[1]/div[4]/div[2]/div[1]/div[12]/div[3]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]",
                "asynchronous_ai_overview": false,
                "markdown": "![YOD - Hebrew for the letter &quot;Y&quot; Classic Round Sticker | Zazzle](https://api.dataforseo.com/cdn/i/10110523-2762-0139-0000-d44311c13ea9:4)\nThe Hebrew letter [Yod](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yodh) (י) is the tenth letter of the [Hebrew alphabet](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/137082/jewish/Yud.htm).[[1]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/137082/jewish/Yud.htm)\n\n### Key Details\n\n- **Shape and Size:** It is the smallest letter in the Hebrew script, looking like a tiny floating dot, comma, or hook.\n- **Numerical Value:** Its gematria (numerical value) is **10**.\n- **Pronunciation:** It sounds like the English consonant **\"y\"** (as in \"yellow\") or can act as a long vowel **\"i\"**.\n- **Meaning:** The name means **\"hand\"** or **\"arm\"** (*yad*).[[1]](https://www.hebrew4christians.com/Grammar/Unit_One/Aleph-Bet/Yod/yod.html)[[2]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t3jIc1D0cDg&t=5)[[3]](https://hebrewtoday.com/alphabet/the-letter-yud-%D7%99/)[[4]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dtxhEggdBKA)[[5]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/137082/jewish/Yud.htm)[[6]](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yodh)[[7]](https://blogs.timesofisrael.com/12-the-letters-of-the-lord-the-letter-yod/)\n\n### Symbolic Significance\n\n- **Divine Presence:** It is the first letter of the Tetragrammaton (the four-letter name of God, YHWH) and many significant biblical names like Israel and Jerusalem.\n- **Completeness:** The number 10 represents order and completion, seen in the Ten Commandments and the ten utterances of creation.\n- **Scriptural Precision:** In Matthew 5:18, it is referenced as the \"jot\" (tiniest stroke), representing the enduring detail of the law.[[1]](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t3jIc1D0cDg&t=5)[[2]](https://www.hebrew4christians.com/Grammar/Unit_One/Aleph-Bet/Yod/yod.html)[[3]](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1687348774926200/posts/3803580776636312/)[[4]](https://gabrielelevy.com/pages/the-letter-yod)[[5]](https://biblehub.com/topical/y/yod.htm)",
